---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
import Comments from "../../components/Comments.astro";
import { whatsappLink } from "../../config";
---

<Layout
	title="SEO for Small Businesses in Kenya: 30-Day Plan | Orbit"
	description="DIY SEO for Kenyan SMEs: Business Profile, buyer keywords, speed and reviews. 30-day checklist with free tools — works with any designer."
>
	<Navbar />
	<main id="main">
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5">
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/3 h-[400px] w-[600px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-electric/15 blur-[130px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-14 pt-20 md:pt-28">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric">■ Guides · SEO · 7 min</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
					SEO that brings <span class="text-gradient">customers, not charts.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-400">30 days, free tools only. No ranking guarantees — just what actually moves Kenyan SMEs.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Week 1 — Google Business Profile (half your traffic)</h2>
			<ol class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 list-decimal list-inside">
				<li>Claim/verify at business.google.com — use exact street + estate, not "Nairobi".</li>
				<li>Add 10 real photos (shop, team, work), correct hours, WhatsApp number as primary.</li>
				<li>Pick primary category that matches paying search: e.g. <em class="text-white">Women's clothing store</em> not <em class="text-white">Fashion designer</em>.</li>
				<li>Write 750-char description with 2 buyer phrases naturally (e.g. "bridal dresses in Eastleigh").</li>
				<li>Enable messaging + booking link. Post 1 update/week (offer, new stock, before/after).</li>
			</ol>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">Week 2 — Buyer keywords, not vanity keywords</h2>
			<div class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-edge">
				<table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-panel text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400"><tr><th class="px-4 py-2">Skip</th><th class="px-4 py-2">Target</th></tr></thead>
				<tbody class="divide-y divide-edge text-slate-300"><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">"best hairstyles 2026"</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-white">barber Nairobi CBD open now</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">"fashion trends Kenya"</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-white">ankara dresses Eastleigh price</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">"website design"</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-white">web designer Mombasa M-Pesa store</td></tr></tbody></table>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">Free method: type your service in Google, note autocomplete + "People also ask" + related searches at bottom — those are buyer phrases. Put one primary phrase per page in title + H1 + first paragraph.</p>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">Week 3 — Speed (Google ranks fast pages)</h2>
			<ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<li>→ Test at <a href="https://pagespeed.web.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-electric hover:underline">pagespeed.web.dev</a> on Mobile — aim 90+ (Orbit ships 95+).</li>
				<li>→ Compress images to &lt;200KB with <a href="https://squoosh.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-electric hover:underline">squoosh.app</a>, use lazy loading.</li>
				<li>→ Check Core Web Vitals in Search Console → Experience.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">Week 4 — Reviews = rankings</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Each genuine review lifts map rank and conversion. Script to copy:</p>
			<div class="mt-3 rounded-xl bg-panel border border-edge p-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">Hi [Name], thanks for choosing us! A quick Google review helps others find us — 30 secs: [your /review link]. Asante! 🙏</div>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">Ask every happy customer, reply to every review in 24h, never buy fake reviews — Google removes them and drops you.</p>

			<div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-electric/20 bg-electric/5 p-6">
				<h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Copy-paste 30-day checklist</h3>
				<ul class="mt-3 grid gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-300">
					<li>☐ GBP claimed + 10 photos + posts on</li>
					<li>☐ 5 buyer keywords mapped to 5 pages</li>
					<li>☐ Titles/H1s rewritten; PageSpeed 90+ confirmed</li>
					<li>☐ 10 review requests sent; reply template saved</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-400">Timeline: local terms move in 2–4 months. Anyone guaranteeing page 1 is selling you. More on our <a href="/seo-services-kenya" class="text-electric hover:underline">SEO services page</a>.</p>

			<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-panel p-6">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Where Orbit fits</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Every Orbit site ships 95+ speed, GBP setup and buyer-keyword titles. Want it done? <a href={whatsappLink("Hi Orbit! I want my business to rank on Google. Where do I show up now?")} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-electric hover:underline">Chat on WhatsApp →</a></p>
			</div>
		</article>

		<Comments slug="seo-small-business-kenya" />
		<CtaBand title="Want customers from Google?" text="Send what you sell + where — free read on what ranking actually takes." />
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
